g responsibility for our life and about finding the right balance between giving and taking. Horses intuitively feel where there is confusion or imbalance in these orders and show us gently new insights, perspectives and the next steps for finding a solution."}]]}],["$","div",null,{"className":"text-center","children":[["$","div",null,{"className":"w-16 h-16 bg-sage-600 rounded-full flex items-center justify-center mx-auto mb-4","children":["$","svg",null,{"className":"w-8 h-8 text-white","fill":"currentColor","viewBox":"0 0 20 20","children":[["$","path",null,{"d":"M9 2a1 1 0 000 2h2a1 1 0 100-2H9z"}],["$","path",null,{"fillRule":"evenodd","d":"M4 5a2 2 0 012-2h8a2 2 0 012 2v6a2 2 0 01-2 2H6a2 2 0 01-2-2V5zm3 3a1 1 0 000 2h.01a1 1 0 100-2H7zm3 0a1 1 0 000 2h3a1 1 0 100-2h-3zm-3 4a1 1 0 100 2h.01a1 1 0 100-2H7zm3 0a1 1 0 100 2h3a1 1 0 100-2h-3z","clipRule":"evenodd"}]]}]}],["$","h4",null,{"className":"text-lg font-semibold text-gray-900 mb-3","children":"Equine Behavior"}],["$","p",null,{"className":"text-gray-600 text-sm leading-relaxed","children":"Understanding how horses naturally respond to systemic dynamics, using their sensitivity to family patterns to guide healing and reveal hidden truths."}]]}]]}],["$","div",null,{"className":"mt-8 p-6 bg-white/60 rounded-xl","children":["$","p",null,{"className":"text-gray-700 leading-relaxed text-center","children":[["$","strong",null,{"children":"Integration:"}]," These three elements work together to create a powerful healing modality. Horses, with their natural sensitivity to systemic dynamics, become our guides in revealing family patterns and supporting resolution through the Orders of Love."]}]}]]}],["$","div",null,{"className":"bg-white rounded-2xl overflow-hidden shadow-sm","children":["$","div",null,{"className":"grid lg:grid-cols-2 gap-0","children":[["$","div",null,{"className":"relative h-64 lg:h-auto","children":["$","$L8",null,{"src":"/images/training/herd-environment.jpeg","alt":"Horses in natural herd env